      "text": "List<List<Integer>> result = new ArrayList<>();\nfor(int i = 0;i<nums.length;i++){\n\nList<Integer> row = new ArrayList(i+1);\nfor(int j = 0;j<i+1;j++){\nif(j==0|| j==i){\nrow.add(1);\n}else{\nint num = result.get(i-1).get(j-1)+ result.get(i-1).get(j);\nrow.add( num);\n\n\n\n}\n\nresult.add(row);\n\nreturn result;",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "List<List<Integer>> result = new ArrayList<>();\nfor(int i = 0;i<nums.length;i++){\n\nList<Integer> row = new ArrayList(i+1);\nfor(int j = 0;j<i+1;j++){\nif(j==0|| j==i){\nrow.add(1);\n}else{\nint num = result.get(i-1).get(j-1)+ result.get(i-1).get(j);\nrow.add( num);\n\n\n\n}\n\nresult.add(row);\n\nreturn result;",
