      "text": "int i = m-1;\nint j = n-1;\nint k = m+n-1;\n\nwhile(j>=0){\n   if(i>=0 && num1[i]>num1[j]){\n num1[k] = num1[i];\ni--;\n}else{\n\nnum1[k] = num2[j];\nj--;\n}",
